# CAT-2026 Required Training Course Catalog

This catalog lists every course in the {{ org.short }} LMS that satisfies a required-training item under POL-CT-001. Durations are seat time. "Recertification" is the interval the LMS uses to create the next assignment; "none" means the course is completed once unless an event triggers retraining.

