{% if c.code == "EHS-FL-101" %}- Notes: Classroom theory plus supervised practical training on the truck type the operator will use. Completion does not authorize operation; the operator must also pass EHS-FL-201.
{% elif c.code == "EHS-FL-201" %}- Notes: Practical evaluation performed by an EHS-qualified evaluator under SOP-EHS-007. Required before first operation and every 36 months, and after any refresher trigger.
{% elif c.code == "EHS-FL-210" %}- Notes: Annual online refresher required by POL-CT-001 v3.2. It does not replace the 36-month practical evaluation.
{% elif c.code == "HR-HAR-200" %}- Notes: Meets the California 2-hour supervisor requirement. May be completed in segments within 30 days, as long as the full 120 minutes are recorded.
{% elif c.code == "HR-HAR-100" %}- Notes: Meets the California 1-hour nonsupervisory requirement, including the abusive conduct and gender identity, gender expression and sexual orientation components.
{% elif c.code == "EHS-RSP-110" %}- Notes: Includes a qualitative or quantitative fit test. Employees must complete the medical evaluation questionnaire before the fit test (SOP-EHS-012).
{% elif c.code == "EHS-BBP-100" %}- Notes: Includes a live Q&A session with a knowledgeable trainer, as required for bloodborne pathogens training. Learners can submit questions in the LMS; e-learning alone is not sufficient.
{% elif c.code == "PRV-HIP-110" %}- Notes: Covers {{ org.short }}'s own privacy policies and procedures; external HIPAA courses cannot substitute for it.
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
